# Wished waves, from start to a won battle (Moddy-Worlds#55, #58). An arena built by command in a plain world, with
# wished waves ON (the default; the arena's own playtests prove its base mechanics with them off). Every wave's
# monsters are wished by the arena through the Builder: they arrive under its pillars a moment after the wave begins,
# one in four is a shadow champion (a Builder design the arena made at the battle's start), every capped monster is
# held at the wish ladder's limits, and wave 5's boss, Rumble the Ravager, is wished UNCAPPED. The waves are cleared
# by command (the arena's own playtests prove fighting them), each counted down only once every monster has arrived;
# the fifth cleared is a won battle, and the arena is tidied.
# play-timeout: 900
@intent with wished waves on, a battle in an arena built by command runs all five waves to a win: monsters arrive under the arena's pillars, a shadow champion design in wave 1, every monster the arena's, the boss wished uncapped, and the arena tidied after
@world flat seed=7
@continue-on-fail

@step build the arena and set it quick
@wait 3s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy
moddy arena create pit confirm
@expect chat /Built the arena pit/ within 60s
moddy arena config pit countdownSeconds 4
@expect chat /countdownSeconds for pit is now 4 seconds/ within 10s
moddy arena config pit breatherSeconds 3
@expect chat /breatherSeconds for pit is now 3 seconds/ within 10s
moddy arena config pit bossBreatherSeconds 3
@expect chat /bossBreatherSeconds for pit is now 3 seconds/ within 10s

@step wave 1: wished under the pillars, a shadow champion among them
moddy arena start pit
@expect chat /The first comes in 4 seconds/ within 10s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 20s
@repeat 400 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,tag=wishmob]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,tag=wishmob]
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,tag=!moddy_world_wished]
@aim look 0 15
@wait 10t
@shot wave-1-with-champion
@repeat 400 until execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 10t
@end-repeat
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 30s

@step waves 2 to 4, each wished and cleared
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 30s
@repeat 400 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@repeat 400 until execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 10t
@end-repeat
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared within 30s
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 30s
@repeat 400 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@repeat 400 until execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 10t
@end-repeat
@expect chat Wave 3 cleared within 30s
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 30s
@repeat 400 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@repeat 400 until execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 10t
@end-repeat
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 30s

@step wave 5: the boss, wished uncapped, and the win
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 30s
@repeat 400 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Rumble the Ravager"]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,tag=moddy_world_wished_uncapped]
execute store result score #hp arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #hp arenatest matches 150..
@shot boss-wave
@repeat 400 until execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 10t
@end-repeat
@expect title You won within 30s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 30s
